
<!-- ══════════ EVIDENCE INTEGRITY ══════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--warm" id="integrity" aria-labelledby="h-int">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>Evidence integrity</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-int" data-rise data-delay="1">An audit trail that<br>can&rsquo;t be quietly edited.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">Every event is hashed and chained to the one before it.
        Change anything after the fact and the chain breaks &mdash; visibly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dgm-wrap" style="margin-top:var(--s12)" data-rise>
      <div class="dgm-wrap__cap">
        <span class="tiny">Case JN-2214 &middot; hash-chained event log</span>
        <span class="pill pill--gr">Tamper-evident</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chain"><div class="chain__b"><span class="chain__t">12:41:06</span>
        <span class="chain__l">Case opened</span><span class="chain__h">sha256 3f9a&hellip;e2 &larr; prev</span></div><div class="chain__b"><span class="chain__t">12:41:52</span>
        <span class="chain__l">Consent</span><span class="chain__h">sha256 b81c&hellip;07 &larr; prev</span></div><div class="chain__b"><span class="chain__t">12:43:18</span>
        <span class="chain__l">PAN capture</span><span class="chain__h">sha256 4de0&hellip;9b &larr; prev</span></div><div class="chain__b"><span class="chain__t">12:45:11</span>
        <span class="chain__l">Liveness</span><span class="chain__h">sha256 a2f7&hellip;c4 &larr; prev</span></div><div class="chain__b"><span class="chain__t">12:57:41</span>
        <span class="chain__l">Decision</span><span class="chain__h">sha256 9f2e&hellip;44 &larr; prev</span></div></div>
      <div class="chain__lg">
        <span class="pill">SHA-256 on every event</span>
        <span class="pill">&larr; prev &mdash; linked backwards</span>
        <span class="pill pill--gr">A broken link is a visible alarm</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════ INTEGRATION ══════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="integration" aria-labelledby="h-api">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>Integration footprint</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-api" data-rise data-delay="1">One REST call in.<br>One webhook out.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">No SDK to embed. Your LOS, underwriting or claims system
        requests a verification URL, hands it off, and listens for a signed webhook on decision.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="g g--2" style="align-items:stretch">
      <div class="code" data-rise>
        <div class="code__b"><span class="code__d"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span>POST /v1/cases/issue-url</span></div>
<pre>{
  <span class="k">"process_id"</span>: <span class="s">"mortgage_property_fi"</span>,
  <span class="k">"external_application_id"</span>: <span class="s">"LAP-99214"</span>,
  <span class="k">"subject"</span>: {
    <span class="k">"type"</span>: <span class="s">"property"</span>,
    <span class="k">"ref"</span>: <span class="s">"PROP-7741"</span>,
    <span class="k">"declared_address"</span>: <span class="s">"..."</span>
  },
  <span class="k">"capture_mode"</span>: <span class="s">"field"</span>,
  <span class="k">"checklist"</span>: [<span class="s">"front_elevation"</span>,
                <span class="s">"address_plate"</span>,
                <span class="s">"interior"</span>,
                <span class="s">"neighbour_ref"</span>]
}

<span class="m">&rarr;</span> signed webhook on decision
<span class="c">// geo + timestamp on every artefact</span>
<span class="c">// retries 5m / 30m / 2h / 6h / 24h</span></pre>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s4);justify-content:space-between">
        <div class="g g--2" style="margin-top:0;gap:var(--s4)">
          <div class="stat" data-rise data-delay="1">
            <div class="stat__v">1</div>
            <div class="stat__k">REST call<br>to integrate</div></div>
          <div class="stat" data-rise data-delay="2">
            <div class="stat__v" data-count="100" data-suffix="%">100%</div>
            <div class="stat__k">Audit<br>coverage</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" data-rise data-delay="3">
          <span class="num">Step 01 &middot; your system</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top:.5rem">Request a URL</h3>
          <p>One call with the case reference and the process to run.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-rise data-delay="4">
          <span class="num">Step 02 &middot; Jaano</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top:.5rem">Run the verification</h3>
          <p>Agent-led, field or self-serve &mdash; your checklist, questions and branding.</p></div>
        <div class="card" data-rise data-delay="5">
          <span class="num">Step 03 &middot; your system</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top:.5rem">Receive the outcome</h3>
          <p>Decision, evidence and hash-chained audit trail, once a reviewer signs off.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

